1
00:00:00,523 --> 00:00:06,733
(Sheldon:)Empty room.

2
00:00:06,896 --> 00:00:09,106
If somebody says "Come in,"
I'm gonna freak out.

3
00:00:14,938 --> 00:00:17,748
(Bernadette:)So, Emily, why did you decide
to specialize in dermatology?

4
00:00:17,907 --> 00:00:19,907
(Emily:)I like cutting people with knives,

5
00:00:20,076 --> 00:00:23,616
(Emily:)and all the other jobs where
you get to do that are illegal.

6
00:00:25,281 --> 00:00:27,391
(Bernadette:)You're kidding, right?

7
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:33,620
(Raj:)She's scary,
but it's a cute scary.

8
00:00:34,591 --> 00:00:35,801
(Howard:)Can I say just one more thing?

9
00:00:35,959 --> 00:00:38,599
(Howard:)I had some kind
of food poisoning that day.

10
00:00:38,762 --> 00:00:41,432
(Howard:)Sure, in retrospect,
gas station sushi...

11
00:00:41,598 --> 00:00:42,978
(Howard:)Maybe not the best choice.

12
00:00:43,133 --> 00:00:45,973
(Howard:)Nor was climbing out
your window and running away.

13
00:00:46,136 --> 00:00:48,806
(Howard:)But I think we can all understand
how humiliating that was,

14
00:00:48,972 --> 00:00:50,312
(Howard:)and I'd really appreciate it
if we could move on.

15
00:00:50,473 --> 00:00:52,313
(Bernadette:)Howie, we moved on
a long time ago.

16
00:00:52,475 --> 00:00:54,785
(Howard:)-I'm just saying--
-We moved on.

17
00:00:56,312 --> 00:01:01,022
OK. Fine.

